# Eudora, Lightning Weaver

> Eudora was the throwaway tutorial mage for nine years, then patch 2.1.47 quietly turned her into a burst mage with real teamfight reach. The 2.1.88 buff ([patch notes](/patch-notes)) extended Superconductor to 5 seconds, and that window now decides every fight she enters. She is no longer the joke pick, but she is also not free.

