## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.95 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Burst Pickoff (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings, Wishing Lantern
- Core: Genius Wand, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Magic Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when your lane is safe enough that more frequent Superconductor setups matter more than early flat Magic Penetration.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when one diver can reach you before the stun lands and you need Frozen to survive the first commit.; Glowing Wand over Wishing Lantern when Use when the enemy has healing or shield sustain that keeps targets alive after the first burst window.
- Total cost: 12010 gold

Default ranked mid build that turns Eudora's Superconductor mark into fast pickoff damage before adding late shield and HP-based finishing pressure.

### Reset Teamfight Control (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Lightning Truncheon, Fleeting Time, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Lightning Truncheon, Fleeting Time, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Genius Wand over Fleeting Time when Use when your team is not securing assists consistently and you need guaranteed Magic Defense shred instead of ultimate reset tempo.; Arcane Boots over Magic Boots when Use when the enemy mid laner is punishable early and you can snowball before cooldown cycling matters.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when a second engage reaches you after Flicker is down and raw shield value will not save the fight.
- Total cost: 12080 gold

Assist-driven teamfight setup for games where Eudora can repeatedly trigger Thunder's Wrath around grouped objectives.

### Anti-Dive Survival (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Genius Wand, Winter Crown, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Immortality
- Core: Genius Wand, Winter Crown, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Wilderness Blessing, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Blood Wings over Immortality when Use when poke is wearing you down between fights but the enemy does not have enough lockdown to force a death reset item.; Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy dive is damage-heavy but not control-heavy enough to justify Fortitude and Purify together.; Ice Queen Wand over Immortality when Use when your team needs extra slow control after the stun rather than another late death insurance layer.
- Total cost: 11700 gold

Defensive mid build for chain-control and dive drafts where Eudora must live through the first engage before casting her full marked combo.

